# Breaking the prologue's loop (game/loop_break.h): spectating, three direction presses. Each is
# a hit: a burst of light round the cycle, the screen flashing towards white and the camera
# jolting, harder each time. Shots straight after each press, while the burst flies out. The
# third breaks it: the camera comes down into the cycle at the arena's centre (3 s, arrival.steps),
# then play in 1st person, the bot coming in.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
start_intro # the opening flight, from wherever the game boots (run.sh)
# Hurry it (any button but START or Z, once: x3), so it lands in about 3 s
press b
wait 3.5
wait 4
press left
shot hit1_a
shot hit1_b
shot hit1_c
wait 1
press up
shot hit2_a
shot hit2_b
shot hit2_c
wait 1
press right
shot hit3_a
shot hit3_b
shot hit3_c
wait 3.5
shot broken
